ame": "2024 HG screen 3.png", "id": "422911767473865", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AvyCq5GhpkQQ7kNvwGBEB6K&_nc_oc=AdmGz54G00xDNUorg5pl3m88xG9gXWkX347SZsjVyrs7hMiOCqEPo-09uTCVJ35zr88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxAGgvg04lKtofyUFzwRFnbtIYj3U_rg5gmpG5e6R4P_Q&oe=69B02028"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L1Rm52YJYSYQ7kNvwHLkAcH&_nc_oc=AdnhotBlRF7p8SkUbleTISh6TpwiD2DsEcfiPbqbVOZqxtKyoP13F_KYZOUGx6JbvE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwnjhBj5ufcbciwzTbNDLEGfW-MWFyhNzJ1mHDhUHVwAw&oe=69B028A2"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6tEpJvPflCMQ7kNvwH8J3_V&_nc_oc=AdnBROKC-VmW-H3VZVEDPhc8PJM_vZRIxju9dgmJeoc6MCxKYqruq2J7JcpfLZN0rLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwLlncbXNqCo4KIBtge8l3MAFXZ5pOlqhHQq0B81buP4Q&oe=69B00BE1"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=diKPk40atkgQ7kNvwECtfqN&_nc_oc=AdmHmq5Osz2DyzLMDu1_8RaHhu3idq4oXlj-U5CRP5LnNte6LnsODbuLxbjxe7AY5Xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwJ6bLlnYpCWBX1xt9eKlrrZALSVOZGffYjKtqCzczMnA&oe=69B026FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gGIv50JoNIcQ7kNvwHJhFXG&_nc_oc=Adm7VUttcmwiUfoe_fPAH9xVpHhiMnU6HxSkz8lstKfNhUoWZjqw8Q37j9000SZiRaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx9PaCii6Wj9plCE70uk9fQX3gzkmMjCC9TKiiuoksRtg&oe=69B00425"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_